# v3: there are no generated documents in this tree. Anything a view layer ever
# produces is ignored here so it can never be committed and can never be mistaken
# for the record. The record is data/*.csv, data/decisions/*.md and BLOCKS.md.
*.html
*.svg
*.stamp
VIEW.*
MANUAL.*
view.json
outputs/
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.html
!99-ARCHIVE/**/*.svg
!01-REFERENCE/**/*.html

# Rendered document names from v2 - never regenerate these at the top of an area
DESIGN.md
SHOPPING-LIST.md
INSTALL.md
QUESTIONS.md
DECISIONS.md
LOG.md
WIRE-TABLES.md
ANSWERS.md
!99-ARCHIVE/**

# Scratch
__pycache__/
*.py[co]
*.tmp
*.typed-in.bak

# IDE and OS state
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Built binaries
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
